  "description": "The Hard Tri-Fold Tonneau Cover will be latched when folded down, eliminating the need for manual operation. This feature ensures enhanced security and convenience, providing effortless access while keeping your cargo secure.\nFeatures\nVehicle-Specific Fitment: Designed specifically for 2004–2014 Ford F-150 with a 6.5 ft truck bed, ensuring a secure and precise installation with embedded clamps and reinforced hardware.\nHeavy-Duty FRP Construction: Constructed with high-strength fiberglass reinforced panels to support heavy loads and protect cargo from rain, snow, and sharp impacts.\nEasy No-Drill Installation: Includes detailed instructions and all necessary mounting hardware for quick installation—no drilling required. (Cargo racks must be removed before installation.)\nSecure Tri-Fold Design: Reinforced locking mechanism, bullet-style wrench clamps, and nylon safety straps keep the cover firmly closed and stable during driving.\nAdded Utility Features: Comes with a complimentary LED bed light for improved visibility and safer cargo access in low-light conditions.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2004-2014 Ford F150 6.5ft truck Short bed",
